  "notes": "Modified cash basis village. Governmental statement lines from the Total Governmental Funds column (p4). Taxes 151,316 split using the Statement of Activities general receipts Property taxes 71,628 + Sales and use tax 79,688 (p2), exact. Intergovernmental 118,175 split into Motor vehicle tax 70,725 + State aid and equalization 47,450 (p2), exact. Grants and donations 42,929 split into operating grants 7,531 + capital grants 35,398 (p2), exact; no grantor printed (category other, detail Grants). Net interfund transfers (33,469) out of governmental funds to the Utilities fund. Fund balances (not cash) in the fund_balance fields; cash null as in later years. Business-type lines from the modified cash business-type statement (p6), which ties to the Statement of Activities (p2: disbursements 1,482,564; charges 174,369; capital grants 1,050,838; interest 1,651; transfers 33,469) and the budget schedule Utilities row (p7: receipts 1,226,858). No proprietary cash flow statement. Balance sheet: governmental lines from the governmental funds balance sheet (p3; totals equal p1), business-type lines and totals from p1. Detail: the only supplementary schedule (p7) is a combined all-funds budget schedule, so detail is one line per fund column of the governmental funds statement (p4) and the business-type statement (p6). Read pages 1-7 of 7"
